   indexes.</p>

            cluster_config: str?  # <p>Container for the cluster configuration of a domain.</p>

            ebs_options: str?  # <p>Container for the parameters required to enable EBS-based storage for an OpenSearch Service
   domain.</p>

            domain_name: str  # <p>Name of the OpenSearch Service domain to create. Domain names are unique across the domains
   owned by an account within an Amazon Web Services Region.</p>

            engine_version: str?  # <p>String of format Elasticsearch_X.Y or OpenSearch_X.Y to specify the engine version for the
   OpenSearch Service domain. For example, <code>OpenSearch_1.0</code> or
    <code>Elasticsearch_7.9</code>. For more information, see <a href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/opensearch-service/latest/developerguide/createupdatedomains.html#createdomains">Creating
    and managing Amazon OpenSearch Service domains</a>.</p>

            log_publishing_options: {str: str}?  # <p>Key-value pairs to configure log publishing.</p>

