            permissions: [str]?  # <p>A structure that describes the principals and the resource-level permissions on an
            analysis. You can use the <code>Permissions</code> structure to grant permissions by
            providing a list of Identity and Access Management (IAM) action information for each
            principal listed by Amazon Resource Name (ARN). </p>
         <p>To specify no permissions, omit <code>Permissions</code>.</p>



            # Outputs

            request_id_output?: str  # <p>The Amazon Web Services request ID for this operation.</p>

            status_output?: int  # <p>The HTTP status of the request.</p>

