         twice. You can use any string up to the maximum length.</p>

            description: str?  # <p>A description for this job. You can use any string within the permitted length.
         Descriptions don't need to be unique and can be used for multiple jobs.</p>

            report: str  # <p>Configuration parameters for the optional job-completion report.</p>

            role_arn: str  # <p>The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) for the Identity and Access Management (IAM) role that Batch Operations will
         use to run this job's action on every object in the manifest.</p>



