         <p>_ . : / = + \ - @</p>
         <p>For more information, see <a href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/appstream2/latest/developerguide/tagging-basic.html">Tagging Your Resources</a> in the <i>Amazon AppStream 2.0 Administration Guide</i>.</p>

