            string.</p>
         <p>Constraints: Must contain no more than 255 alphanumeric characters. Cannot be the word
            "Default".</p>
         <p>Example: <code>mysecuritygroup</code>
         </p>

            description: str  # <p>A description for the cache security group.</p>





