            passthrough_behavior: str?  # <p>Specifies the pass-through behavior for incoming requests based on the Content-Type header in the request, and the available mapping templates specified as the <code>requestTemplates</code> property on the Integration resource. There are three valid values:  <code>WHEN_NO_MATCH</code>, <code>WHEN_NO_TEMPLATES</code>, and <code>NEVER</code>.
