         2018-05-29 version of the request mapping template.</p>

            description: str?  # <p>The <code>Function</code> description.</p>

            max_batch_size: int?  # <p>The maximum batching size for a resolver.</p>

            api_id: str  # <p>The GraphQL API ID.</p>

