            "key1=value1&key2=value2..."</p>
            <p>For the cli-input-json file use format: "tags":
            "key1=value1&key2=value2..."</p>
         </note>

            policy_name: str  # <p>The policy name.</p>

            policy_document: str  # <p>The JSON document that describes the policy. <b>policyDocument</b> must have a minimum length of 1, with a maximum length of
         2048, excluding whitespace.</p>



