      either
      <code>SUN</code>,
      <code>MON</code>, <code>TUE</code>, <code>WED</code>, <code>THU</code>, <code>FRI</code>, or <code>SAT</code>. This field is required if the <code>frequency</code>
      parameter is set to <code>WEEKLY</code> or <code>BIWEEKLY</code>.</p>

