            status is not set to another terminal state before the timer expires, it will be automatically 
            set to <code>TIMED_OUT</code>.</p>

            tags: [str]?  # <p>Metadata which can be used to manage updates.</p>

            ota_update_id: str  # <p>The ID of the OTA update to be created.</p>

            description: str?  # <p>The description of the OTA update.</p>

            aws_job_abort_config: str?  # <p>The criteria that determine when and how a job abort takes place.</p>

            protocols: [str]?  # <p>The protocol used to transfer the OTA update image. Valid values are [HTTP], [MQTT], [HTTP, MQTT]. When both
           HTTP and MQTT are specified, the target device can choose the protocol.</p>

            files: [str]  # <p>The files to be streamed by the OTA update.</p>

