      available in all the Amazon Web Services Regions where GuardDuty is presently supported. For more 
      information, see <a href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/guardduty/latest/ug/guardduty_regions.html">Regions and endpoints</a>.</p>

            features: [str]?  # <p>A list of features that will be configured for the detector.</p>

            enable: bool  # <p>A Boolean value that specifies whether the detector is to be enabled.</p>

            client_token: str?  # <p>The idempotency token for the create request.</p>



            # Outputs

            tags_output?: {str: str}  # <p>The tags of the detector resource.</p>

            finding_publishing_frequency_output?: str  # <p>The publishing frequency of the finding.</p>

