            Insight resource
            """

            filters: str  # <p>One or more attributes used to filter the findings included in the insight. The insight
         only includes findings that match the criteria defined in the filters.</p>

            group_by_attribute: str  # <p>The attribute used to group the findings for the insight. The grouping attribute
         identifies the type of item that the insight applies to. For example, if an insight is
         grouped by resource identifier, then the insight produces a list of resource
         identifiers.</p>

            name: str  # <p>The name of the custom insight to create.</p>




