         configured for the gateway, this field returns 0.</p>

            disk_ids_output?: [str]  # <p>An array of the gateway's local disk IDs that are configured as working storage.
         Each local disk ID is specified as a string (minimum length of 1 and maximum length of
         300). If no local disks are configured as working storage, then the DiskIds array is
         empty.</p>

            working_storage_allocated_in_bytes_output?: int  # <p>The total working storage in bytes allocated for the gateway. If no working storage is
