         that has not been persisted to Amazon Web Services. The sample is taken at the end of the
         reporting period.</p>

            cache_used_percentage_output?: float  # <p>Percent use of the gateway's cache storage. This metric applies only to the
         gateway-cached volume setup. The sample is taken at the end of the reporting period.</p>

            cache_hit_percentage_output?: float  # <p>Percent of application read operations from the file shares that are served from cache.
         The sample is taken at the end of the reporting period.</p>

            cache_miss_percentage_output?: float  # <p>Percent of application read operations from the file shares that are not served from
         cache. The sample is taken at the end of the reporting period.</p>

