         and <code>GetSimilarProfiles</code> API to return and review the results. Also, if you have
         configured <code>ExportingConfig</code> in the <code>RuleBasedMatchingRequest</code>, you
         can download the results from S3.</p>

            default_expiration_days: int  # <p>The default number of days until the data within the domain expires.</p>

            tags: {str: str}?  # <p>The tags used to organize, track, or control access for this resource.</p>



            # Outputs

            rule_based_matching_output?: str  # <p>The process of matching duplicate profiles using the Rule-Based matching. If
