      of mount targets.</p>

            mount_targets_output?: [str]  # <p>Returns the file system's mount targets as an array of
        <code>MountTargetDescription</code> objects.</p>

            marker_output?: str  # <p>If the request included the <code>Marker</code>, the response returns that value in
      this field.</p>




