               </p>
            </li>
            <li>
               <p>Array with three addresses: <code>"Addresses": ["192.0.2.44/32", "192.0.2.0/24", "192.0.0.0/16"]</code>
               </p>
            </li>
            <li>
               <p>INVALID specification: <code>"Addresses": [""]</code> INVALID </p>
            </li>
         </ul>

