            using the configuration set.</p>

            reputation_options: str?  # <p>An object that defines whether or not Amazon Pinpoint collects reputation metrics for the emails
            that you send that use the configuration set.</p>

            sending_options: str?  # <p>An object that defines whether or not Amazon Pinpoint can send email that you send using the
            configuration set.</p>

            tags: [str]?  # <p>An array of objects that define the tags (keys and values) that you want to associate
            with the configuration set.</p>



            # Outputs

