            using the configuration set.</p>

            delivery_options_output?: str  # <p>An object that defines the dedicated IP pool that is used to send emails that you send
            using the configuration set.</p>

            reputation_options_output?: str  # <p>An object that defines whether or not Amazon Pinpoint collects reputation metrics for the emails
            that you send that use the configuration set.</p>

            sending_options_output?: str  # <p>An object that defines whether or not Amazon Pinpoint can send email that you send using the
