            Scene resource
            """

            scene_metadata: {str: str}?  # <p>The request metadata.</p>

            workspace_id: str  # <p>The ID of the workspace that contains the scene.</p>

            scene_id: str  # <p>The ID of the scene.</p>

            capabilities: [str]?  # <p>A list of capabilities that the scene uses to render itself.</p>

